Negative control for recommendations-template.test.ts.

Looks the brand's template up in the layout record unchecked, so the full
layout is no longer the fallback: no template, an empty one, or a name no
recommendations layout carries draws no layout, and an inherited name such as
`constructor` draws a non-layout. The full template still draws its own layout.

Intended RED (recommendations-template.test.ts, "recommendationsTemplate"):
  draws the full layout for no template
  draws the full layout for an empty template
  draws the full layout for a template only other pages carry
  draws the full layout for a name no layout carries
  draws the full layout for a name every object inherits
Intended GREEN:
  draws the layout the full template carries

